[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:How Are You Today?]
[00:00.70]Lesson 9 | 第9课
[00:02.16]How are you today? | 你今天好吗？
[00:05.13]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.00]How is Emma? | 艾玛好吗？
[00:14.10]Hello Helen. | 你好，海伦。
[00:16.87]Hi Steven. | 嗨，史蒂文。
[00:18.86]How are you today? | 你今天好吗？
[00:21.37]I'm very well thank you. | 我很好，谢谢。
[00:24.22]And you? | 你呢？
[00:25.49]I'm fine thanks. | 我很好，谢谢。
[00:28.66]How is Tony? | 托尼好吗？
[00:30.34]He's fine thanks. | 他很好，谢谢。
[00:33.25]How's Emma? | 艾玛好吗？
[00:34.79]She's very well too Helen. | 她也很好，海伦。
[00:37.98]Goodbye Helen. | 再见，海伦。
[00:40.55]Nice to see you. | 很高兴见到你。
[00:42.24]Nice to see you too Steven. | 史蒂文，我也很高兴见到你。
[00:45.90]Goodbye. | 再见。